{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-91-1","title":"Psalms 91:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The state of the godly. 3 Their safety. 9 Their habitation. 11 Their servants. 14 Their friend; with the effects of them all.</p>\n<p>(Title.)This Psalm is supposed by some to have been composed by Moses on the same occasion as the preceding; but others think it was written by David, after his advice to his son Solomon.</p>\n<p>1Ch 28:1-21 dwelleth. 27:5; 31:20; 32:7; 52:8; 61:3,4; 90:1; Isa 8:14; Eze 11:16 Ho 14:5,6; 1Jo 4:15,16 abide. Heb. lodge. 25:13; *marg: under. 17:8; 36:7; 57:1; Jud 9:15; So 2:3; Isa 4:5,6; La 4:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-2","title":"Psalms 91:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I will. 9; 18:2; 46:1; 71:3; 142:5; De 32:30,31; 33:27-29; Pr 18:10 my God. 43:4; 48:14; 67:6,7; Ge 17:7; De 26:17-19; Jer 31:1; Lu 20:38 Heb 11:16 in him. 62:5-8; Isa 12:2; 26:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-3","title":"Psalms 91:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>snare. 124:7; 141:9; Pr 7:23; Ec 9:12; Ho 9:8; Am 3:5; 1Ti 6:9; 2Ti 2:26 and from. 6; Nu 14:37,38; 16:46-48; 2Sa 24:15; Job 5:10-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-4","title":"Psalms 91:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>cover. 17:8; 57:1; 61:4; De 32:11; Ru 2:12; Mt 23:37 his truth. 89:23,24; 138:2; Ge 15:1; Isa 43:1,2; Mr 13:31; Tit 1:2 Heb 6:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-5","title":"Psalms 91:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Thou. 3:6; 27:1-3; 46:2; 112:7; Job 5:19-27; Pr 28:1; Isa 43:2; Mt 8:26 Heb 13:6 terror. 3:5; 2Ki 7:6; Job 4:13-15; 24:14-16; Pr 3:23-25; Isa 21:4 Lu 12:20,39 nor. Job 6:4; La 3:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-6","title":"Psalms 91:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>pestilence. 121:5,6; Ex 12:29,30; 2Ki 19:35 destruction. Nu 16:48; 2Sa 24:15; Mt 24:6,7; 1Co 10:3-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-7","title":"Psalms 91:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>32:6; Ge 7:23; Ex 12:12,13; Nu 14:37,38; Jos 14:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-8","title":"Psalms 91:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Only. 37:34; 58:10,11; 92:11; Pr 3:25,26; Mal 1:5 reward. Isa 3:11; Heb 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-9","title":"Psalms 91:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Because. 2; 142:4,5; 146:5,6 most high. 1; 71:3; 90:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-10","title":"Psalms 91:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>There. 121:7; Pr 12:21; Ro 8:25 neither. De 7:15; Job 5:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-11","title":"Psalms 91:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>For. 34:7; 71:3; 2Ki 6:16,17; Mt 4:6; Lu 4:10,11; Heb 1:14 in all. Pr 3:6; Isa 31:1; Jer 2:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-12","title":"Psalms 91:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>They. Isa 46:3; 63:9 lest. 37:24; Job 5:23; Pr 3:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-13","title":"Psalms 91:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>tread. Jud 14:5,6; Job 5:23; 1Sa 17:37; Da 6:22; 2Ti 4:17 adder. or, asp. 58:4; Mr 16:18; Ac 28:3-6; Ro 3:13; 16:20 the dragon. Isa 27:1; Re 12:9; 20:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-14","title":"Psalms 91:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>set. 9; 1Ch 29:3; Joh 14:23; 16:27; Ro 8:28; Jas 1:12; 2:5 I will set. 59:1; *marg: 89:16,17; Isa 33:16; Php 2:9-11 known. 9:10; Joh 17:3; Ga 4:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-15","title":"Psalms 91:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>He shall. 10:17; 18:3,4,15; Isa 58:9; 65:24; Jer 29:12,13; 33:3; Ro 10:12,13 Heb 5:7 I will be. 23:4; 138:7; Isa 41:10; 43:1,2; Mt 28:20; Joh 16:32; Ac 18:9,10 2Ti 4:17 deliver. 37:40; 2Co 1:9,10 honour. 1Sa 2:30; Joh 5:44; 12:26,43; 1Pe 1:21; 3:22; 5:4; Re 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-91-16","title":"Psalms 91:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":91,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":91,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>With long life. Heb. With length of days. 21:4; Ge 25:8; Job 5:26; Pr 3:2,16; 22:4; Isa 65:20-22 shew. 16:11; 50:23; Isa 45:17; Lu 2:30; 3:6</p>"}]}